Scope of this license

This license covers only the source code and documentation written for this
project. It does NOT cover:

- Astronomy Picture of the Day (APOD) images, videos and texts, or any other
  NASA images. These belong to their credited authors (many are copyrighted)
  and are shown as NASA publishes them, with their credit.
- Data from third-party services (NASA, NASA/JPL, NOAA, CCMC, STScI/MAST, CDS,
  Caltech/IPAC and the authors of GCN Circulars), including the saved samples
  in test/fixtures/ and the data visible in the screenshots in
  docs/screenshots/. That data remains under its providers' own terms.
- Third-party libraries and fonts installed through npm (for example three.js,
  D3 and IBM Plex), which keep their own licenses.
